*** Instance Resources for AWS *** 

The instance in Amazon Web Services that hosts the services of: 
Mosquitto MQTT, InfluxDB, Home Assistant and Node-RED, 
must contain the following requirements:

-- Operative System --
* Debian 12 (x86_64) 
-- Instance Type --
* t3. medium (2 vCPU and 4 GiB Memory)
-- RAM Memory --
* 4 GiB Memory
-- Storage --
* 40 GiB



